				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-63ba88a" data-id="63ba88a" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0b2c79c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0b2c79c" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>A new reality of international cooperation and foreign aid is upon us. In times of change, we see opportunity—a chance to reimagine how we serve communities together.</p><p>Today, more than <b>170,000 health workers</b> across<b> 21 countries</b> use Community Health Toolkit-powered apps to deliver digitally supported care. There are human stories behind these figures: lives touched, families supported, communities strengthened.</p><p><b>But this is just the beginning. </b>Digital transformation in healthcare is accelerating, and we&#8217;re charting a new path forward.<br /><br />Find out more in our 2024 Annual Report.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a621f99 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="a621f99" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="button.default">
